• ತೋಟದ ಮಧ್ಯೆ ಹಸಿರೆಲೆ ಗೊಬ್ಬರ ಅಥವಾ ಅಂತರ ಬೆಳೆಗಳನ್ನು ಬೆಳೆಯಬಹುದು', NULL, '• Apply recommended manure and fertilizer based on LRI by ploughing in the middle of the garden
• Green manure or intercrops can be grown in the middle of the garden', NULL, 'NIL', 'NIK', TO_TIMESTAMP('2026-05-26 15:47:52', 'YYYY-MM-DD HH24:MI:SS'), NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Y');
