• Ploughing the field and providing fertilizers as recommended based on LRI
• Green manure crops or intercropping can be grown', NULL, 'NIL', 'NIK', TO_TIMESTAMP('2026-05-26 15:47:52', 'YYYY-MM-DD HH24:MI:SS'), NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Y');
