• ಅಥವಾ ತೋಟದ ಮಧ್ಯ ಅಂತರ ಬೆಳೆಗಳನ್ನು ಬೆಳೆಯಬಹುದು', NULL, '• Planting plants if irrigation facilities are available. After planting, apply fertilizer as recommended based on LRI
• Providing support for the planted plants with stakes
• After planting pomegranate, growing green manure plants such as jute, sorghum or buckwheat in the middle of the garden can increase the fertility of the soil
• Or intercropping can be done in the middle of the garden', NULL, NULL, 'SIK', TO_TIMESTAMP('2026-05-26 15:47:53', 'YYYY-MM-DD HH24:MI:SS'), NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Y');
