• ಅಥವಾ ತೋಟದ ಮಧ್ಯ ಅಂತರ ಬೆಳೆಗಳನ್ನು ಬೆಳೆಯಬಹುದು', NULL, '• Ploughing the garden and applying the recommended manure and fertilizer based on LRI
• Pruning unwanted branches to shape the plants (for more information, see the Lemon Crop System in the software)
• Growing green manure crops such as jute, sorghum or buckwheat can increase soil fertility
