• Mulching the soil to maintain soil moisture', NULL, 'NIL', 'NIK', TO_TIMESTAMP('2026-05-26 15:47:52', 'YYYY-MM-DD HH24:MI:SS'), NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Y');
