• Growing green manure crops such as jute, sorghum or gram can increase soil fertility', 'If termite infestation is found, mix 4 ml of Chlorpyrifos 20 EC per liter of water and pour about 2-3 liters of the solution around the plant for each plant', 'NIL', 'SIK', TO_TIMESTAMP('2026-05-26 15:47:53', 'YYYY-MM-DD HH24:MI:SS'), NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Y');
