•To prevent sapling rot, add 1% Bordeaux mixture or 2 g Copper Oxychloride 50 WP per liter of water and spray it around the seedlings that are suffering from rot', 'NIL', 'SIK', TO_TIMESTAMP('2026-05-26 15:47:53', 'YYYY-MM-DD HH24:MI:SS'), NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Y');
