• ಅಥವಾ ತೋಟದ ಮಧ್ಯ ಅಂತರ ಬೆಳೆಗಳನ್ನು ಬೆಳೆಯಬಹುದು', NULL, '• Planting another plant in a place where the plant is not established
• Growing green manure plants such as jute, sorghum or buckwheat in the garden can increase the fertility of the soil
