• ಅಥವಾ ತೋಟದ ಮಧ್ಯ ಅಂತರ ಬೆಳೆಗಳನ್ನು ಬೆಳೆಯಬಹುದು', NULL, '• If irrigation facilities are available, plant the seedlings/transplants in the middle of the ridges and provide support for the stake. After planting, apply fertilizer as recommended based on LRI 
