• ಅಥವಾ ತೋಟದ ಮಧ್ಯ ಅಂತರ ಬೆಳೆಗಳನ್ನು ಬೆಳೆಯಬಹುದು', NULL, '• Drain excess water from the garden and plant seedlings/transplants in the middle of the ridges to provide support for the stake. Apply fertilizer as recommended based on LRI after planting 
• After planting, grow green manure crops like jute, sorghum or gram in the garden to increase soil fertility
• Or grow intercropping crops in the middle of the garden', NULL, NULL, 'SIK', TO_TIMESTAMP('2026-05-26 15:47:53', 'YYYY-MM-DD HH24:MI:SS'), NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Y');
